{"id":"4b28706879995352","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md","title":"真理反思与T-out合成局部反思","display":"thm-reflection-from-truth — 真理反思与T-out合成局部反思","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-reflection-from-truth","aliases":["91-thm-reflection-from-truth"],"display":"thm-reflection-from-truth — 真理反思与T-out合成局部反思","depends_on":["[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]","[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-reflection-from-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-reflection-from-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reflection-from-truth — 真理反思与T-out合成局部反思"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-reflection-from-truth-—-真理反思与-T-out-合成局部反思\">thm-reflection-from-truth — 真理反思与 T-out 合成局部反思</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> (含算术、真理谓词和 PA 可证性谓词的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>\n(待反思的基础语言公式类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span> (PA 的标准可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\)</span> (算术句编码谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>\n(数码代入编码的对象语言函数项)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (PA 的真理化全局反思句)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}from\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\\,\n\\left[\n\\left(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\left(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left[\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)\n\\right]\n\\right)\n\\right]\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}from\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\\,\n\\left[\n\\left(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\left(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left[\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)\n\\right]\n\\right)\n\\right]\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对每个数码实例，先由全局反思把 PA 可证性送入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，再由所列统一\nT-out 释放回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\vec x)\">\\(\\varphi(\\vec x)\\)</span>，即得到\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。句子编码条件用于消去\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}\\)</span> 前件。</p>\n<p>统一 T-out 可由 UTB 对相应基础公式的统一双条件给出；全局反思则必须\n另行证明。UTB 单独不证明全部 PA 局部反射，否则取\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\bot\">\\(\\varphi=\\bot\\)</span> 就会证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>，与其算术\n保守性冲突。</p>\n<p>同样，逐句模式不等于对象语言中的单个全局句\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(\\mathrm{Sent}(x)\\land\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x))\">\\(\\forall x(\\mathrm{Sent}(x)\\land\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x))\\)</span>。\n后者需要统一句法编码与更强的证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-reflection-from-truth-—-真理反思与-T-out-合成局部反思","text":"thm-reflection-from-truth — 真理反思与 T-out 合成局部反思","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}from\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\\,\n\\left[\n\\left(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\left(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left[\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)\n\\right]\n\\right)\n\\right]\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi=\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x(\\mathrm{Sent}(x)\\land\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x))","display":false}],"bytes":2497,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[9